cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: neuro-decoding
abstract: 'Cross-validated decoding of behaviour from population activity aligned by neuro-align: ridge, MLP and
  Bayesian decoders for continuous variables, logistic regression for trial variables, blocked cross-validation,
  circular-shift and label-shuffle null distributions, neuron-dropping curves, per-region decoding, held-out-session
  decoding through aligned latent dynamics, and kNN decoding from CEBRA embeddings.'
